# 🧮 Hisabche — Development Log & Product Roadmap v5.0

---

## 📅 بازه: ۲۲ مه — ۳۱ مه ۲۰۲۶ (UI Engineering v4.0 Complete)

---

## وضعیت فعلی: Foundation Complete + Performance Elite + UI Engineering v4.0 (فاز ۰–۷ + UI Audit)

---

### 🏗️ معماری کلی

```
hisabche/
├── apps/
│   ├── web/          Next.js 16 + React 19 + Turbopack
│   └── mobile/       Expo SDK 51 + React Native 0.74
├── packages/
│   ├── ui/           Design System (shadcn/ui + custom 70+ components)
│   ├── api/          TanStack Query hooks
│   ├── store/        Zustand stores (selector pattern)
│   ├── validation/   Zod schemas
│   ├── i18n/         Dari · Persian · English (200+ keys)
│   ├── db/           WatermelonDB + Drizzle
│   └── auth/         Supabase auth
├── backend/          Fastify 4 + PostgreSQL
└── tooling/          Turborepo · ESLint · TypeScript strict · Prettier
```

---

### 🎨 Design System — 9.8/10 Elite

| ویژگی | توضیح | وضعیت |
|--------|--------|--------|
| **Color tokens** | `--hisab-*` فقط — صفر رنگ hardcode | ✅ |
| **Dark mode** | `color-scheme: light` + `.dark` class + `classList.toggle` | ✅ |
| **Glass variants** | `glass-light` (8px), `glass-medium` (16px), `glass-strong` (28px) — scaled | ✅ |
| **Elevation system** | ۵ سطح (`--elevation-0` تا `--elevation-5`) — shadow-intensity scaled | ✅ |
| **Z-index scale** | `--z-base` تا `--z-debug` | ✅ |
| **Fluid typography** | `clamp()` برای `--text-xs` تا `--text-5xl` | ✅ |
| **Spacing system** | 8px rhythm (`--space-1` تا `--space-8`) | ✅ |
| **CSS Nesting** | سراسر فایل `globals.css` | ✅ |
| **`@property`** | `--gradient-angle` برای shimmer button | ✅ |
| **`@layer` ordering** | `reset → tokens → base → layout → components → utilities → overrides` | ✅ |
| **Container queries** | `.card-host { container-type: inline-size }` | ✅ |
| **View transitions** | `::view-transition-old/new` + `.page-transition` | ✅ |
| **Focus ring** | `:focus-visible` با `--ring-width` و `--ring-color` | ✅ |
| **Touch targets** | 44px برای `@media (pointer: coarse)` | ✅ |
| **Density modes** | `[data-density="compact/comfortable/spacious"]` | ✅ |
| **Forced colors** | `@media (forced-colors: active)` | ✅ |
| **Print styles** | `@page { size: A4; margin: 12mm }` | ✅ |
| **Reduced motion** | `animation-duration: 0.01ms !important` | ✅ |
| **`content-visibility`** | `.section`, `.lazy-paint` | ✅ |
| **`interpolate-size`** | `allow-keywords` برای accordion | ✅ |
| **`field-sizing`** | `content` برای textarea | ✅ |
| **Adaptive System Tokens** | `--motion-scale`, `--shadow-intensity`, `--glass-blur-scale` | ✅ |
| **Idle GPU Offload** | `body.idle` reduces tokens + pauses animations | ✅ |
| **Low-Perf Mode** | `[data-perf="low"]` aggressive GPU offload | ✅ |
| **Intersection Gating** | `[data-offscreen="true"]` freezes offscreen elements | ✅ |
| **Responsive Blur** | Mobile: 8-12px, Tablet: 12-16px, Desktop: 24px | ✅ |
| **Shadow System** | `--hisab-shadow-sm/md/lg/glass` aliases | ✅ |
| **Modern Reset** | `@layer reset` with full modern CSS reset | ✅ |
| **RTL Logical CSS** | `text-start/end`, `ms/me`, `ps/pe`, `border-s/e` — all 70+ components | ✅ |
| **Accessibility** | `aria-label`, `aria-hidden`, `role`, `aria-live`, `aria-expanded`, `aria-selected` | ✅ |

