### 📄 صفحات — Architecture v4.0

| فایل | نوع | توضیح |
|------|------|--------|
| `page.tsx` | Server Component | metadata + Container/Client import |
| `loading.tsx` | Server Component | Skeleton (standalone or shared) |
| `*-page.tsx` | Client Component (Pure UI) | Props-driven, zero hooks |
| `*-container.tsx` | Client Component | All logic (router, store, api, i18n) |
| `*-client.tsx` | Client Component | Dynamic import wrapper (where needed) |
| `index.ts` | Barrel | Named exports only |

