### 🔐 Auth Flow

| ویژگی | وضعیت |
|--------|--------|
| Race condition | ✅ `hasHydrated` + `useEffect` + `router.replace` |
| `hasHydrated` + `isAuthenticated` sync | ✅ |
| Login → Dashboard | ✅ بدون flicker |
| Logout → Landing | ✅ `router.replace` smooth |
| Auth Gate | ✅ `hisab-root` + `glass-card` |
| Route protection | ✅ `robots: { index: false }` |
| Zustand selectors | ✅ `useAuthStore(s => s.isAuthenticated)` |

