### 🧠 Provider Architecture v3 — 9.8/10

| Layer | Priority | Components |
|-------|----------|------------|
| **Layer 0** | SSR-safe | `QueryProvider`, `I18nProvider` |
| **Layer 1** | Post-hydration | `LanguageInitializer`, `ThemeInitializer` |
| **Layer 2** | Idle boot | `AdaptiveUIInitializer`, `AuthInitializer`, Analytics |

| Feature | Status |
|---------|--------|
| Tiered hydration | ✅ |
| Analytics off-main-thread (`requestIdleCallback`) | ✅ |
| `classList.toggle("dark")` sync | ✅ |
| `languageChanged` event → re-render | ✅ |
| Performance detection (`navigator.hardwareConcurrency`) | ✅ |
| Idle detection (3s timeout) | ✅ |
| IntersectionObserver offscreen gating | ✅ |

---

### ⚡ Performance Optimizations

| بهینه‌سازی | تأثیر | وضعیت |
|-------------|--------|--------|
| **Bundle splitting** (dynamic import) | Initial JS −۶۰٪ | ✅ |
| **Skeleton هماهنگ با layout** | CLS = ۰ | ✅ |
| **`loading.tsx`** | Navigation skeleton فوری | ✅ |
| **`content-visibility: auto`** | Render فقط viewport | ✅ |
| **Adaptive blur** | Mobile: 8px, Desktop: 24px | ✅ |
| **Mobile glow orbs disabled** | GPU savings | ✅ |
| **`will-change` only on hover** | Memory savings | ✅ |
| **`contain: strict/layout paint`** | Paint isolation | ✅ |
| **Font self-host + `font-display: optional`** | FCP −300ms | ✅ |
| **`font-size-adjust: from-font`** | No FOUT shift | ✅ |
| **`text-wrap: balance/pretty`** | Typography quality | ✅ |
| **`font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums`** | اعداد حسابداری | ✅ |
| **Zustand selectors** | `useStore(s => s.field)` | ✅ |
| **`useCallback`/`useMemo`** | Stable references | ✅ |
| **`requestIdleCallback` analytics** | INP improvement | ✅ |
| **Idle animation pause** | `body.idle { --motion-scale: 0 }` | ✅ |
| **Low-perf mode** | `[data-perf="low"]` aggressive GPU offload | ✅ |

